        "id": 1212794
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-07T00:24:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of allowing for 2 possible behaviors, my preference would be to write the test to only allow 1 (since we know which path we are going down, we should assert that is what happens).",
      "revId": "0749aaf95ffc183b9db186506b52f98fd980c5e6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52cb16fb_dacd7989",
        "filename": "test/usb_tcpmv2_td_pd_src3_e7.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 85,
      "author": {
        "id": 1346479
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-07T16:29:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would test the current behavior of the code and not the compliance of the current code with the exact test. I prefer to allow as close as possible an implementation to the specified compliance test. This could lead to less flaky tests that depend on implied timing, order and functionality. The desire is to make sure we pass the test with the current implementation and not that we verify that the current implementation has remained the same.",
      "parentUuid": "29d9f483_03f4f2d2",
      "revId": "0749aaf95ffc183b9db186506b52f98fd980c5e6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "26a1f089_574cc021",
        "filename": "test/usb_tcpmv2_td_pd_src3_e7.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 85,
      "author": {
        "id": 1212794
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-07T17:01:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If there is a regression that causes our implementation to reply PD_CTRL_NOT_SUPPORTED when it should reply PD_EXT_SOURCE_CAP I think it is good to have a test that checks this and fails.\n\nHow about checking some config variable in the test to decide whether PD_CTRL_NOT_SUPPORTED or PD_EXT_SOURCE_CAP should be expected?",
      "parentUuid": "52cb16fb_dacd7989",
      "revId": "0749aaf95ffc183b9db186506b52f98fd980c5e6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2d8b8be8_0fac584b",
