        "id": 1346479
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-07T17:11:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The purpose of this and all of the compliance tests was to verify as close as possible that GRL will pass, this is why I did not like the addition of the additional three tests on the end of compliance. If we need additional non-compliance tests to cover regressions for all of the current functionality and messages possible then I don\u0027t think that should be covered here.",
      "parentUuid": "26a1f089_574cc021",
      "revId": "0749aaf95ffc183b9db186506b52f98fd980c5e6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
